         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.45</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.45 removes suspended SyQon and AutoDBE tools from selectable dropdowns and displays gray temporarily-unavailable notices below their stages.</li>
               <li>Restoring a saved suspended selection disables its stage rather than silently executing a replacement. Inactive SyQon setup controls are hidden; stored settings are retained.</li>
               <li>The complete native PixInsight dialog check and all 23 regression scripts passed.</li>
               <li>Retains the script-loading fix and CPD transition safeguards. Native tools remain available; dependency review and PTeam clarification remain open.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
